From 1e62234f02b407579ba8043ef437054eea3a151a Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Xinzheng Long <quic_xinzlong@quicinc.com>
Date: Tue, 12 Apr 2022 13:29:47 +0530
Subject: [PATCH] omxvideoenc: property to support rotation using VPU

added new property rotate
Config will be set to rotate frames
in 90deg clockwise, 180deg and 90deg
counter clockwise based on respective
enum value set to rotate property
Currently supported for AVC and HEVC

Signed-off-by: Xinzheng Long <quic_xinzlong@quicinc.com>
---
